+### Ordering against other phases
+- **D-19:** Phase 4.1 starts after Phase 4's automated close, plan 04-42 (which depends on 04-28 voice under v2, 04-29 exact-id third list, 04-33 to 04-36 chunking profiles, 04-37 and 04-38 golden additions and re-baseline, 04-39 fixture sweep and calibration, 04-40 D-28 comparison, 04-41 two-tenant matrix). Hard reasons: voice runs legacy on trunk until 04-28 (`src/lib/rag/pipeline.ts:497`); 04-38 changes the golden set and baselines the gate compares against; 04-39 writes the fixture cells `v2-default` uses; 04-42 folds `hybrid_search_chunks` into both setup files so fresh installs have it. 04-43 (live, `autonomous: false`) is not a prerequisite; its live cells refine refusal later without a default change (D-01).
